[stderr] title: Define safe inventory and party progression contract
[stderr] dependencies: R0004,R0015
[stderr] requirement_ids: REQ-0004,REQ-0008,NFR-0002
[stderr] source_specifications: specification/02-feature-model.md#5-inventory-party-progression-and-economy,specification/03-technical-contract.md#data-contract
