[stderr] +Add deterministic shared-core negative fixtures and cross-domain invariants for
[stderr] +the SHARD-02 campaign contracts. The work proves that invalid references,
[stderr] +blocked routes, stale commands, and duplicate grants are detected without
[stderr] +introducing concrete campaign content.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Dependencies
[stderr] +
[stderr] +R0013 supplies scene/exit validation, R0014 quest transitions, R0015 encounter
[stderr] +and reward resolution, and R0016 inventory/party protection. This contract owns
[stderr] +fixtures and invariant assertions only; it does not change their APIs or state
[stderr] +rules. GATE-0004 remains explicit for concrete content assumptions.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Ownership
