[stderr] +Do not create product maps, dialogue, characters, combatants, assets, audio,
[stderr] +real player data, browser-matrix tests, UI, persistence drivers, or concrete
[stderr] +content values. Do not resolve GATE-0004.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Asset assessment
