+---
+task_id: R0019
+sequence: 19
+title: Add campaign domain invariant and negative-fixture coverage
+dependencies: R0013,R0014,R0015,R0016
+requirement_ids: REQ-0002,REQ-0003,REQ-0004,NFR-0007
+source_specifications: specification/02-feature-model.md#2-exploration-town-dungeon-and-campaign-content,specification/02-feature-model.md#4-party-combat-encounters-rewards-and-balance
+source_catalogue_ids: IMP-0019
+authoring_batch: B0008
+factory_stages: F011,F012,F013
+asset_impact: not_applicable
+asset_ids:
+asset_brief: No assets; deterministic invalid-state fixtures only.
+audio_impact: not_applicable
